# Facts about Professor Marisol.

@fact marisol.tides
tier: surface
text: Teaches the tidecalling half of Evocation, waist-deep in the lake at dawn, and keeps the lake calm on exam days.

@fact marisol.poems
tier: personal
unlock: seen(marisol_intro) > 0
text: She reads poems about water in the rain, under a dry patch of air, and never remembers their last lines.

@fact marisol.storms
tier: personal
unlock: seen(marisol_storm) > 0
text: She goes out into the worst storms of the year on purpose. She says nobody learns tides on a calm day.

@fact marisol.margins
tier: personal
unlock: seen(marisol_trust) > 0
text: She wrote her own tidecalling into the margins of a book of poems when she was a student, and still teaches from it.
